  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s core contribution to the World Organisation Against Torture (OMCT) 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a core contribution to support OMCT and its SOS-Torture Network fulfil the activities and programmatic goals under the organisation&#x2019;s Strategic Plan 2021-2024 in the period 2023-2024. The project focuses on human rights and torture prevention. The key objective is to advance toward the eradication of torture worldwide, by strengthening the growth, sustainability, cooperation, and impact of the global civil society anti-torture movement.</narrative>
  </description>
